00:05:34.883 --> 00:05:37.498
By June, I will have been blank for a year.

92
00:05:37.798 --> 00:05:41.336
A, training. B, train. C, trained.

93
00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.818
The answer is A: training.

94
00:05:47.983 --> 00:05:50.436
Continuing even when it is hard is blank.

95
00:05:50.736 --> 00:05:55.271
A, perseverance. B, fulfillment. C, reward.

96
00:05:58.833 --> 00:06:01.077
The answer is A: perseverance.

97
00:06:02.217 --> 00:06:05.087
Small steps forward over time are blank progress.

98
00:06:05.387 --> 00:06:09.505
A, incremental. B, strategic. C, long-term.

99
00:06:13.067 --> 00:06:15.507
The answer is A: incremental.

100
